      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation specific for executing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> based <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against\n<a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对执行基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> 的 <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 的 <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 实现，该实现专门用于与 <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> 交互。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation specific for executing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> based <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against\n<a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对执行基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 的 <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 而专门设计的 <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 实现，用于针对 <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> object from given <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> and potentially converts it into a store specific\nrepresentation that can be used by the <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 对象中解析出排序信息，并可能将其转换为特定存储实现所支持的表示形式，以便供 <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> allows to pass on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> to the actual query\nprocessor.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> 允许将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 传递给实际的查询处理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation of <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> holds <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> to delegate find and\ncount execution to.",
      "translation": "<KeyValueAdapter>接口的<a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\">基本实现</a>包含一个<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a>，用于委托执行查找和计数操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Forwards <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>CloseableIterator</code></a> invocations to the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> delegate.",
      "translation": "将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/util/CloseableIterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>CloseableIterator</code></a>` 的调用转发到配置的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>` 委托。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation to compare objects based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a>实现的比较器，用于根据<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>对对象进行比较。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation for accessing and executing <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against a <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供访问并针对 <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 执行操作的基类实现，该操作作用于 <a href=\"KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 实现的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SortAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SortAccessor</code></a> implementation capable of creating <a href=\"SpelPropertyComparator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelPropertyComparator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SortAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的接口\"><code>SortAccessor</code></a> 实现，能够创建 <a href=\"SpelPropertyComparator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的类\"><code>SpelPropertyComparator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> implementation for key/value stores that converts the given runtime\nexception to an appropriate exception from the <code>org.springframework.dao</code> hierarchy.",
      "translation": "一个简单的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a>实现，用于键值存储，可将给定的运行时异常转换为来自<code>org.springframework.dao</code>层次结构的适当异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface for <code>QueryEngineFactory</code> implementations that provide a <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> object as part of the\nconfiguration.",
      "translation": "为提供作为配置一部分的<a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a>对象的<code>QueryEngineFactory</code>实现提供的接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the criteria object from given <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从给定的<a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>解析出条件对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Converter capable of transforming a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> into a collection type.",
      "translation": "能够将给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> 转换为集合类型的转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
